        },
        {
          "text": "Ijambo ry’Uhoraho rinzako, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.23.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 23:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "riti Mwana w’umuntu, būrira ba kamenyi bo mu Bisirayeli, ubūrire abagenda bavugishwa n’ibiva mu mitima yabo ubgabo, ubabarire, uti Ni mwumve ijambo ry’Uhoraho: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, ati Bazobona ibara, abo ba kamenyi b’ibipfu, bakurikira ivyiyumviro vyabo ubgabo, kand’ ata co beretswe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yemwe Bisirayeli, ba kamenyi banyu bameze nk’imbgebge zo mu bitongozi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.22.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 22:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntimwarushe mudūga ngo muje mu birengero vyo ku rugo rw’inzu ya Isirayeli, canke ngo mubizibire, kugira ngo babone ingene bashikama mu ntambara ku musi w’Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.5.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 5:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.14.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.12.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 12:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.22.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abavuga ngo Ni k’Uhoraho agize, kand’ Uhoraho atābatumye; beretswe ubusa bo n’indagu z’ibinyoma, kandi bizigiza abantu kw ijambo ryabo rizoshika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbega ntimwarose inzozi z’ubusa, n’indagu mwavuze s’ibinyoma, ko muvuga ngo Ni k’ Uhoraho agize, na we ata co yavuze?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rer’ uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, ngo Ko mwavuze ibitagira ikimazi, mukerekwa ibinyoma, ngw Ehe muzohigūra na we, ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.7.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 7:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.20.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 20:38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngo Kand’ ukuboko kwiwe kuzorwanya abo ba kamenyi berekwa ibitagira ikimazi, bakaragura ibinyoma: ngo Nta ho bazoba mu nama y’abantu biwe na mba, canke ngo bandikwe mu gitabo c’amazina c’inzu ya Isirayeli, canke ngo bashike mu gihugu c’Abisirayeli; ngo Kandi muzomenya kw ari we Mwami Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.6.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 6:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.22.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 22:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngw Ivyo bizoba kuko bama bazimiza abantu biwe, bavuga ngo N’amahoro; kand’ ata mahoro ariho; ngo Kand’ iyo hagize uwubaka urusika, baruhomakw ingwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.38.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 38:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barira abaruhomakw ingwa yuko ruzohomvoka: hazogwa imvura y’ isegenya; namwe mwa mināna y’urubura, muzogwa; maz’ umuyaga w’ikirura urusiture. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Non’ urwo rusika ni rwahomvoka, mbega ntimuzobazwa, ngw Iryo homa mwāruhomye ryagiye hehe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero, ni jewe Umwami Uhoraho mbivuze, nti Mbere nzorusituza umuyaga w’ikirura nshangashiwe; hazogwa imvura y’isegenya izanywe n’uburake bganje, kand’ ubushangashirwe bganje buzotuma imināna y’urubura irukombora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uko ni ko nzohomvora urusika mwahomesheje ingwa, ndarusenyurire hasi, bitume itanguriro ryarwo rigaragazwa: nuko ruzohomvoka, namwe muherengeterezwe hagati muri rwo; ni ho muzomenya yuko jewe nd’ Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uko ni ko nzoshitsa uburake bganje ku rusika no ku bāruhomesheje ingwa; kandi nzobabgira, nt’ Urusika ntirukiriho, cank’ abāruhomye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ari bo ba bandi ba kamenyi bo mu Bisirayeli bavuga ivy’ i Yerusalemu, bakaharotera inzozi z’amahoro, kand’ ata mahoro ariho, ni jewe Umwami Uhoraho mbivuze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
